-power)\n- [KRONIKA](#kronika)\n- [ESTA.](#esta)\n- [Sasha Marie](#sasha-marie)\n- [IAMNOBODI](#iamnobodi)\n- [Jared Jackson](#jared-jackson)","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":0,"location":"UN","published_at":"2021-04-10T16:00:00+00:00"},"title":"IAMNOBODI","position":7}},{"id":"zlwc6NfBcPw","position":42,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"2Pac - Do for Love","track":{"id":"7ikCwelu7BA","path":"/artists/2pac/tracks/do-for-love/","slug":"do-for-love","title":"Do For Love","artist":{"slug":"2pac","title":"2Pac"},"artwork":"images/artists/2pac/tracks/do-for-love.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"BDetsr-_b9I","slug":"154","tags":[1,15],"links":{},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #154","artwork":"/images/episodes/154.jpg","content":"Joe Kay really displayed a crazy selection of music that will have you copying/pasting consistently within Google for some time. \n\n<!--more-->\n\nThere are a lot of new tunes sprinkled with the 'feel-good' classics that we always connect to our sets. It's essential for us to keep educating you with the influences and how it all connects to where we are today. Spread this set to as many people as possible! More minds and ears need to hear this music!\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10901,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-11-30T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"I6wQOmhaK94","position":91,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"2Pac - I Get Around (Mick’s String Edit)","track":{"id":"XnoPm5kB1RM","path":"/artists/2pac/tracks/i-get-around-mick-s-string-edit/","slug":"i-get-around-micks-string-edit","title":"I Get Around (Mick’s String Edit)","artist":{"slug":"2pac","title":"2Pac"},"artwork":""},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"jTSehXE5AIc","slug":"169","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-169"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #169","artwork":"/images/episodes/169.jpg","content":"Plenty of new music stacked ready to share with you.\n<!--more-->\n\nIt felt good to be back after being away from the studio for 4 weeks. We've been traveling for the past month spreading The Sound of Tomorrow at SXSW, WMC, and now Asia. The pros of being away for so long meant that Joe stacked up on plenty of music for the past month which makes up for the lost time, trust. There is too much to say and talk about but shout out to all of the amazing people who came out to our shows to see and connect with us. We are very grateful!\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10838,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-04-05T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"fUzVOxgfGmw","position":23,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"2Pac - Keep Ya Head Up","track":{"id":"pg_Pb09N0wQ","path":"/artists/2pac/tracks/keep-ya-head-up/","slug":"keep-ya-head-up","title":"Keep Ya Head Up","artist":{"slug":"2pac","title":"2Pac"},"artwork":"images/artists/2pac/tracks/keep-ya-head-up.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"MUTAwmt5Mm0","slug":"173","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-173"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #173","artwork":"/images/episodes/173.jpg","content":"Joe Kay makes it to the studio in time to throw down an unforgettable set full of primarily forgotten classics that will have you reminiscing on life.\n\n<!--more-->\n\nAs if this news isn't enough, we just hit 100K here on Soundcloud this past Friday literally while we launched our new residency @ the legendary Echoplex! Talk about timing and accomplishments. THANK you to each and every one of you for supporting us and spreading this sound to everyone. We plan to give you something really soon to celebrate 100K supporters worldwide and more. Big ups to the 900+ people who showed up to The Sound of Tomorrow this past Friday. Very inspiring.\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10836,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-05-03T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Session","position":0}},{"id":"lj1aILzaq9U","position":14,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"2Pac - Do For Love","track":{"id":"7ikCwelu7BA","path":"/artists/2pac/tracks/do-for-love/","slug":"do-for-love","title":"Do For Love","artist":{"slug":"2pac","title":"2Pac"},"artwork":"images/artists/2pac/tracks/do-for-love.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"EVMFTD6oGnE","slug":"180","tags":[8,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/radio-show-180-w-hannah-faith"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #180 w/ Hannah Faith","artwork":"/images/episodes/180.jpg","content":"\n<!--more-->\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10759,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-07-19T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Hannah Faith's Set","position":1}},{"id":"bbUkNUUnfpo","position":1,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"2pac - Do For Love (Instrumental)","track":{"id":"j0sNh9mqa2M","path":"/artists/2pac/tracks/do-for-love-instrumental/","slug":"do-for-love-instrumental","title":"Do For Love (Instrumental)","artist":{"slug":"2pac","title":"2Pac"},"artwork":"images/artists/2pac/tracks/do-for-love-instrumental.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"73dzhgsXfAU","slug":"203","tags":[7,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-203-w-goldlink"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #203 w/ GoldLink","artwork":"/images/episodes/203.jpg","content":"\n<!--more-->\n\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10799,"location":"US","published_at":"2015-02-01T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Conversation w/ GoldLink","position":1}},{"id":"Eew7YM1_Uuw","position":16,"timestamp":"00:43:14","rawTrack":"2Pac - I Get